From ce610d6a36caab4b34caaf60906205863308048a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 20:04:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] HTDESIGNER (tools 0154): the find window's filters --
 assigned / used as a condition / a function
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

EastSun 1003: "你這邊有可以加入讓我勾選篩選條件嗎? 我想加入 被賦予值 或是被當成判斷式 或是是函式 的篩選"
- A 篩選 row of three checkboxes: 被賦予值 (x = ..., += and the other compounds,
  ++ / --, x[i] = / x.y =; == is not), 被當成判斷式 (inside the ( ) of if / while /
  for / switch, or next to == != <= >= < > && || !, or a ? after), 是函式 (a ( right
  after the name). Any one checked = those uses only, comments and strings out;
  none = all, as before. Each result says which use it is; the history keeps the
  filters.
- lib/projectsearch.js classify(masked, text, at, len) on cppstub.mask; hitsIn
  hits carry `at`; search(..., { kinds }) masks / classifies only the files with
  hits. Only the find window passes kinds (the side bar search / the old box never
  filter).
- Window fixes: 大小寫要相同 no longer wraps (the 64px label width hit it); file
  names no longer stack while scrolling (one .fg block per file).
- iHome (whole word, case) here: 327 -> assigned 101, condition 87, function 0,
  about 0.7 s each.

Tests: run_all 3/3 layers (lib 185: 18 forms classified; extension 227: a word
only in a comment = 0 with 函式, strncpy = all calls; panels: the 3 boxes, one
line); real VS Code 156/159 (3 known stale checks; the BtnPanelLane3 / Alias set
failed once and passed on the rerun -- noted in HANDOVER as to look into).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
